    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just about being still. it's that there's nothing left to do. i spent my whole life running toward this one moment, and now that i'm here... i just feel like the race is over. like there's nowhere left to go. what's the point of even waking up tomorrow if the goal is already reached and it changed nothing?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
